            {
              "textRaw": "[m] clickable",
              "name": "[m]_clickable",
              "methods": [
                {
                  "textRaw": "clickable(callback, enabled?)",
                  "type": "method",
                  "name": "clickable",
                  "signatures": [
                    {
                      "params": [
                        {
                          "textRaw": "**callback** { [Function](dataTypes#function) } - 无参数点击回调; 普通函数的 `this` 是当前节点. ",
                          "name": "**callback**",
                          "type": " [Function](dataTypes#function) ",
                          "desc": "无参数点击回调; 普通函数的 `this` 是当前节点."
                        },
                        {
                          "textRaw": "**[ enabled = true ]** { [boolean](dataTypes#boolean) } ",
                          "name": "**[",
                          "desc": "enabled = true ]** { [boolean](dataTypes#boolean) }"
                        },
                        {
                          "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { [ComposeModifier](composeModifierType) } ",
                          "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                          "type": " [ComposeModifier](composeModifierType) "
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "params": [
                        {
                          "name": "callback"
                        },
                        {
                          "name": "enabled?"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  "desc": "<p>事件排队回到脚本所属线程, 回调返回值不用于消费原生事件. 对于自身有原生点击动作的组件, 优先使用节点 <code>onClick</code>; 无该回调时, 渲染器可使用最后一个已启用的 clickable 作为其激活动作. 组件提供 <code>enabled</code> 属性时, <code>enabled: false</code> 也会禁用修饰链的点击.</p>\n"
                }
              ],
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m] clickable"
            },
            {
