            {
              "textRaw": "[m] horizontalScroll",
              "name": "[m]_horizontalscroll",
              "methods": [
                {
                  "textRaw": "horizontalScroll(enabled?)",
                  "type": "method",
                  "name": "horizontalScroll",
                  "signatures": [
                    {
                      "params": [
                        {
                          "textRaw": "**[ enabled = true ]** { [boolean](dataTypes#boolean) } ",
                          "name": "**[",
                          "desc": "enabled = true ]** { [boolean](dataTypes#boolean) }"
                        },
                        {
                          "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { [ComposeModifier](composeModifierType) } ",
                          "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                          "type": " [ComposeModifier](composeModifierType) "
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "params": [
                        {
                          "name": "enabled?"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  "desc": "<p>为普通节点增加滚动容器. 父布局须提供有限的可视尺寸; 不要在同一方向再套没有有限尺寸约束的 LazyColumn/LazyRow. 挂载后可经节点 <code>scrollTo({ offset: 120 })</code> 请求绝对滚动偏移, 单位为物理像素. 若同链包含多个滚动操作, offset 命令作用于最外层, 即第一个滚动操作.</p>\n<p>普通滚动的 <code>onScroll(firstVisibleIndex, offset)</code> 第一参为 null, 第二参为 px 偏移; LazyColumn/LazyRow 则提供数字索引. 默认不会仅因首次挂载触发初始 scroll 回调.</p>\n"
                }
              ],
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m] horizontalScroll"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m] offset",
              "name": "[m]_offset",
              "methods": [
